## 2. PRODUCT VISION

Product name: LabConnect

Product category: HealthTech, diagnostic laboratory marketplace and laboratory management SaaS.

Primary market: Pakistan.

Initial launch strategy: Start in one city, validate real laboratory operations and patient demand, then expand to additional cities.

LabConnect consists of three connected applications:

1. Patient application
2. Laboratory management application
3. Platform administration application

The platform also contains a shared backend, secure document infrastructure, AI services, notification infrastructure and a commercial/subscription system.

### Product mission

Make diagnostic testing easier to discover, compare, book, manage and understand while helping laboratories digitize their daily operations.

### Core positioning

LabConnect is not merely a laboratory directory or appointment-booking website.

It combines:

- Multi-laboratory test discovery and comparison
- Appointment and home collection booking
- Laboratory booking and operations management
- Secure report delivery
- Family health records
- AI-powered report understanding and administrative assistance
- Laboratory subscriptions and booking commissions

The platform must be reliable, trustworthy, accessible, attractive and secure.

