### API security

- Strict schema validation.
- Parameterized database queries.
- Rate limiting.
- CORS restrictions.
- Secure headers.
- Request-size limits.
- Input sanitization where appropriate.
- Safe error responses.
- Protection against IDOR, XSS, CSRF, SQL injection and SSRF.
