- File signature validation.
- File-size limits.
- Malware scanning.
- Private storage.
- Short-lived signed URLs.
- No public report buckets.
- Access audit trails.
- Safe download headers.
- Controlled deletion and retention.

### Data protection

- TLS in transit.
- Encryption at rest.
- Encryption of backups.
- Restricted secrets.
- No credentials in Git.
- Data minimization.
- Consent management.
- Access logs.
- Data export and deletion procedures.
